sequenceDiagram
  participant T as Durable task
  participant S as Storage
  participant E as Deployment service
  T->>S: Commit intent and stable request key
  T->>E: Request deployment with that key
  E-->>T: Accepted
  Note over T: Process dies before outcome commit
  Note over S: Intent exists, outcome is missing
  Note over E: Deployment may already be running
